data: {"id": "aa01945a0b39445e-thinking-parallel_evidence-3200", "run_id": "aa01945a0b39445e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实、冲突与缺口\n\n### 事实（证据支持）\n\n1. **Pod 状态为 Pending，Container 处于 ContainerCreating**：`kubectl_describe` 显示 Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 状态为 **Pending**，容器 `app` 的 State 为 **Waiting / Reason: ContainerCreating**，容器 ID 为空，说明容器进程从未启动。\n\n2. **根因事件：ConfigMap \"unavailable-config\" 不存在**：K8s Events 中持续出现 **FailedMount** 事件：\n   - `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`（x45 over 80m）\n   - `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unatt", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788420778992, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

